  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 7265114aa1e7f41ada19d74a427f9e13, type: 3}
  m_Name: UIJuiceCard
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: xpTURN.Feedback.Samples::xpTURN.Feedback.Samples.SampleCard
  Title: UI Juice
  Try: "Hover and buy the items, hit and heal, fill the XP bar for the reward \u2014
    then pause and do it all again."
  See: "Every UI player runs on the unscaled clock: paused (the sample's time scale
    0), the screen still moves while the Scaled ornament and the cube stop. The bars
    are ProgressBar components \u2014 a loss stays red for a moment, a gain shows
    green before the bar follows. Before plays nothing: the bars jump and the popup
    shows its end at once. The popup's TMP player is made at run time (after the
    TMP check) \u2014 the HUD's Select Player does not pick it."
  Controls: "Mouse \xB7 Arrows \xB7 WASD \xB7 D-pad \xB7 Left stick \u2014 pick \xB7
    Click \xB7 Enter \xB7 Gamepad South \u2014 press \xB7 3 \xB7 Gamepad North \u2014
    pause"
